  "step_by_step_reasoning": "1. Identify edge equipment (BIQSens) collecting sensor data, processed locally by Greengrass and Lambda.\n2. Lambda streams data to cloud AWS IoT Core, which uses rules to route data to Kinesis Data Streams and IoT Analytics.\n3. Kinesis Data Streams routes data to S3 for data lake storage and to Kinesis Data Analytics for real-time anomaly detection.\n4. S3 data lake feeds into SageMaker for model retraining, which updates edge Lambdas.\n5. Kinesis Analytics and IoT Analytics send insights/alerts to QuickSight and the end user.",
